    package, compile, obfuscate, or otherwise produce any plugin, package,
    loader, installer, or other redistributable artifact (each, a "Built
    Artifact"), that Built Artifact MUST visibly and explicitly state that it
    was built with CEPS. The notice MUST:
      (a) include the words "Built with CEPS" (or the equivalent in the
          artifact's primary language); and
      (b) include a link to the CEPS repository:
          https://github.com/m4rker20-rgb/CEPS
    The notice must appear in the artifact itself (for example, in the
    plugin header/metadata or a top-of-file comment emitted by the Software)
    and must not be removed, hidden, or obscured. The Software embeds such a
    notice by default; removing or suppressing it from a Built Artifact is a
